# Assistant working file — never committed
CLAUDE.md

# ---- Reference material, not part of this project ----
# A separate read-only clone of the Model 1 core, used as a source of portable
# RTL. It has its own upstream and its own history.
tools/model1-ref/

# Upstream dependencies, fetched by tools/bootstrap.sh and pinned in deps.lock.
# Never vendored into the repository: licence terms differ per dependency and
# one of them forbids copying outright.
third_party/

